<title>POLAND: KRUSZWICA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 78,900.</title>
<headline>KRUSZWICA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 78,900.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.08 vs   1.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.78 vs   2.64</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.12 vs   4.43</p>
<p> Sales		   39.05 vs  42.12</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   3.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.33 vs   6.78</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.55 vs  11.33</p>
<p> Sales		   86.12 vs  96.44</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish edible fats producer is Zaklady</p>
<p>Tluszczowe Kruszwica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
